#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:84
msgid ""
"Stops one account from filling the server. Leave at 0 unless you need it. "
"You can give one member a different limit on their user profile."
msgstr ""
"Voorkomt dat één account de server vol laat lopen. Laat op 0 staan, tenzij "
