msgstr "Verwijder de GPS-locatie uit geüploade foto's."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:249
msgid ""
"Only the GPS position is removed. Camera details and photo credits stay. "
"Applies to new uploads."
msgstr ""
"Alleen de GPS-positie wordt verwijderd. Cameragegevens en "
"auteursvermeldingen blijven staan. Geldt voor nieuwe uploads."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:280
msgid "Who can upload media"
msgstr "Wie media kan uploaden"

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:286
msgid ""
"Members of the ticked roles can upload. Administrators can always upload. "
"Unticking a role deletes nothing."
msgstr ""
"Leden met de aangevinkte rollen kunnen uploaden. Beheerders kunnen altijd "
"uploaden. Een rol uitvinken verwijdert niets."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:299
msgid "Emails"
msgstr "E-mails"

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:301
msgid ""
"Email members about things they would otherwise miss while away. Members can "
"turn these off with one switch in their profile or the link in any email. "
"Account deletion confirmations are always sent."
msgstr ""
"Stuur leden een e-mail over zaken die ze anders zouden missen als ze weg "
"zijn. Leden kunnen deze meldingen met één schakelaar in hun profiel of via "
"de link in elke e-mail uitzetten. Bevestigingen van accountverwijdering "
"worden altijd verstuurd."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:332
msgid "Send this email"
msgstr "Deze e-mail versturen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:349
msgid "Only logged-in members can see WP MediaVerse"
msgstr "Alleen ingelogde leden kunnen WP MediaVerse zien"

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:350
msgid ""
"Visitors who are not logged in are sent to the login page from Explore, "
"media pages, profiles and Compete, and the API refuses them. Members see "
"everything as before."
msgstr ""
"Bezoekers die niet zijn ingelogd, worden vanuit Verkennen, mediapagina's, "
"profielen en Compete naar de inlogpagina gestuurd, en de API weigert hen. "
"Leden zien alles zoals voorheen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:358
msgid ""
"On: your community plugin keeps this site private, so visitors are already "
"sent to the login page. Change it in that plugin's settings."
msgstr ""
"Aan: je communityplugin houdt deze site privé, dus bezoekers worden al naar "
"de inlogpagina gestuurd. Wijzig dit in de instellingen van die plugin."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:359
msgid ""
"Off: your community plugin decides who can see this site. Turn on its "
"private or members-only mode to hide WP MediaVerse from visitors."
msgstr ""
"Uit: je communityplugin bepaalt wie deze site kan zien. Schakel de privé- of "
"ledenmodus van die plugin in om WP MediaVerse voor bezoekers te verbergen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:385
msgid "Remove Data on Delete"
msgstr "Gegevens verwijderen bij deïnstallatie"

#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:391
msgid "Delete all MediaVerse data when the plugin is deleted."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert alle MediaVerse-gegevens wanneer de plugin wordt verwijderd."

#. translators: 1: uploads folder for media, e.g. wp-content/uploads/wpmediaverse, 2: uploads folder for Pro documents.
#: includes/Admin/Settings/GeneralSettingsRegistrar.php:411
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>This cannot be undone.</strong> When you delete MediaVerse it "
"removes media records, albums and collections, comments, reactions and "
"favorites, messages, settings, member preferences and permissions. Uploaded "
"files are never deleted: they stay in %1$s, MediaVerse Pro private documents "
"(PDFs and other files) stay in %2$s, files on a cloud bucket stay there, and "
"the pages MediaVerse created stay. While MediaVerse Pro is installed, "
"WordPress does not let you delete MediaVerse from the Plugins screen (only "
"with WP-CLI or FTP); if it is removed that way, this choice stays saved so "
"deleting Pro later removes its data too. Leave this off if you might "
"reinstall."
msgstr ""

